{"id":"957b109a5dee371b","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-order11-bounded-lattice.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Bounded Lattice","display":"df-zfc-order11-bounded-lattice — ZFC Order11 Bounded Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-bounded-lattice","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-bounded-lattice"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-bounded-lattice — ZFC Order11 Bounded Lattice","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-bounded-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-bounded-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-bounded-lattice — ZFC Order11 Bounded Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,X,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L,x,y,m,j,u\\in V\">\\(L,X,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L,x,y,m,j,u\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BoundedLattice}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BoundedLattice}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BoundedLattice}_S(L,0_L,1_L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\leq_L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nL=\\langle X,\\leq_L\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,\\leq_L)\n\\land 0_L,1_L\\in X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(0_L\\leq_L x\\land x\\leq_L1_L)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists m,j\\in X\\;\\bigl[\n(m\\leq_Lx\\land m\\leq_Ly\\land\n\\forall u\\in X\\;((u\\leq_Lx\\land u\\leq_Ly)\\to u\\leq_Lm))\n\\land\n(x\\leq_Lj\\land y\\leq_Lj\\land\n\\forall u\\in X\\;((x\\leq_Lu\\land y\\leq_Lu)\\to j\\leq_Lu))\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BoundedLattice}_S(L,0_L,1_L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\leq_L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nL=\\langle X,\\leq_L\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,\\leq_L)\n\\land 0_L,1_L\\in X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(0_L\\leq_L x\\land x\\leq_L1_L)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists m,j\\in X\\;\\bigl[\n(m\\leq_Lx\\land m\\leq_Ly\\land\n\\forall u\\in X\\;((u\\leq_Lx\\land u\\leq_Ly)\\to u\\leq_Lm))\n\\land\n(x\\leq_Lj\\land y\\leq_Lj\\land\n\\forall u\\in X\\;((x\\leq_Lu\\land y\\leq_Lu)\\to j\\leq_Lu))\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Pairwise greatest lower bounds and least upper bounds are stated explicitly.</li>\n<li>The order is carried by the encoded lattice rather than an undeclared ambient symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,X,\\leq_L,0_L,1_L,x,y,m,j,u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BoundedLattice}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BoundedLattice}_S(L,0_L,1_L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\leq_L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nL=\\langle X,\\leq_L\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,\\leq_L)\n\\land 0_L,1_L\\in X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(0_L\\leq_L x\\land x\\leq_L1_L)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists m,j\\in X\\;\\bigl[\n(m\\leq_Lx\\land m\\leq_Ly\\land\n\\forall u\\in X\\;((u\\leq_Lx\\land u\\leq_Ly)\\to u\\leq_Lm))\n\\land\n(x\\leq_Lj\\land y\\leq_Lj\\land\n\\forall u\\in X\\;((x\\leq_Lu\\land y\\leq_Lu)\\to j\\leq_Lu))\n\\bigr]\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1361,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2880","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-order11-bounded-lattice.md|58-df-zfc-order11-bounded-lattice]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5"]}